Hi {Owner},

I build websites for restaurant groups around {City}. {Business Name}'s restaurants have loyal guests, but the site puts every location on one page and the menus are PDFs, so a diner near one of your sites can't see its hours, menu or order button quickly.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a page per location with its own hours, real text menus and ordering, private dining rooms with an enquiry form, a careers page and gift cards that work at every restaurant, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to your domain and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, menu changes and new locations. You approve every page before it goes live. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes with you and your marketing lead this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
